      <activity id="b341a6a0-d887-5aa0-9f71-2fa55f980a11" activityNameId="a68e1f6c-e1d9-59f7-9214-e865249387d1" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wooden board manufacturing plant, cement bonded boards</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wooden board manufacturing plant, cement bonded boards
The service life is assumed to be 50 years. Thus the life time output is 2'500'000 m3 board. This data must only be used to consider the infrastructure needed for wood board production if this is not relevant.;
UUID: 3d785591-507e-3c4a-8c69-f689c5bf5bc7
The land area and the material and their transports needed for for building and disposal of a plant for cement bonded wooden boards with a yearly output of 50"000 m3 is included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Relates to a medium sized production plant for cement bonded wooden boards using one or several stack-presses.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: estimation 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3d785591-507e-3c4a-8c69-f689c5bf5bc7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
